    "description": "<table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:2em; border:2px solid #999; font-size:105%; text-align:center; background:#00008B;\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <td><i><b>This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a> has been <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Tested\" title=\"Category:Tested\">Tested</a> per the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Untested\" title=\"Category:Untested\">Untested</a> guidelines. Whether or not it can be used is, as always, the prerogative of the Gamemaster.</b></i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p><i>The Darksaber equipment data created by Wikia user Chellewalker (formally Wikia user Lukewarner).</i> </p><p><b>Base Item:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Lightsaber_(Weapon)\" title=\"Lightsaber (Weapon)\">Lightsaber</a> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Compressed_Crystal\" title=\"Compressed Crystal\">Compressed Crystal</a>) </p><p><b>Heirloom Bonus:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Legendary_Icon\" title=\"Legendary Icon\">Legendary Icon</a> </p><p>An ancient Lightsaber that serves as a powerful symbol of leadership to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Mandalorians\" title=\"The Mandalorians\">The Mandalorians</a>, The Darksaber is a unique weapon with a black-energy blade lined with a crackling white edge. </p><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Compressed_Crystal\" title=\"Compressed Crystal\">Compressed Crystal</a>:</b> Targets of attacks made with this Lightsaber take a -2 penalty on&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a>&nbsp;checks made to negate the attack with the&nbsp;<b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Block\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Block\">Block</a></b>&nbsp;Talent. </p><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Legendary_Icon\" title=\"Legendary Icon\">Legendary Icon</a>:</b> When carrying this item in plain sight, you gain favorable circumstances on all&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a>-based&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Checks\" title=\"Skill Checks\">Skill Checks</a>&nbsp;(except&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks). </p><p><b>Special:</b>&nbsp;Can be&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Thrown\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a> </p>",
